			"why": "Eratosthenes was one of the chief librarians of the Library of Alexandria, the Ptolemies' library in the city Alexander laid out."
		},
		{
			"to": "mathematics/euclid-elements",
			"why": "Euclid wrote the Elements in Alexandria, the Greek city Alexander founded on the coast of Egypt, under the first Ptolemies."
		},
		{
